From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 18:50:31 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Lapin UX: the chosen system font, and a fading sign-in panel

The lock screen uses the system font picked in Settings > Personalization >
Fonts (Lapin's system_font), and the sign-in screen the last user's; Selawik
stays the default (#62). On the lock screen the sign-in panel's veil fades in
over 200 ms as the panel rises into place, and fades out over the clock face
on Esc, in step with the compositor's blur (#54).

Refs #62, Refs #54

